From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 03:17:41 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] Export user modules and the classes defined in them

The exported package wrote the module source and its _mx_io entries,
but _mx_sys had no reader for ModuleIO/ModuleData, so importing the
package failed with KeyError: 'ModuleIO'. Add MiniModuleIO and
MiniModuleData, which load the module from the exported file as
ModuleIO does in modelx.

References to classes defined in such modules are pickled into
_mx_pickled by ("ModuleAttr", io_data key, class name) and resolved
against the loaded module, as in the model pickle. Without such
classes _mx_pickled is written by pickle.dump as before.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_019ikg7NJaGw75uaSPfLFj8d
